Operator is a physical and environmental object.
Animal is a physical and environmental object.
Animal can be free or caught.
State free is initial.
State caught is final.
Bait is a physical and environmental object.
Trap is a physical and systemic object.
Trap can be sprung or set.
State sprung is initial.
Base is a physical and systemic object.
Locking Bar is a physical and systemic object.
Locking Bar can be disengaged or engaged.
State disengaged is initial.
Catch is a physical and systemic object.
Catch can be released or engaged.
State released is initial.
Transverse Spring is a physical and systemic object.
Jaw is a physical and systemic object.
Jaw can be held back or released.
Trigger is a physical and systemic object.
Trigger can be at rest or pressed.
State at rest is initial.
Bait Receptacle is a physical and systemic object.
Bait Receptacle can be empty or baited.
State empty is initial.
Arm is a physical and systemic object.
Perforated Ears is a physical and systemic object.
Baiting is a physical and systemic process.
Setting is a physical and systemic process.
Triggering is a physical and systemic process.
Springing is a physical and systemic process.
Trap consists of Base, Locking Bar, Catch, Transverse Spring, Jaw, Trigger, Bait Receptacle, Arm, and Perforated Ears.
Operator handles Baiting.
Baiting consumes Bait.
Baiting changes Bait Receptacle from empty to baited.
Operator handles Setting.
Setting changes Locking Bar from disengaged to engaged.
Setting changes Catch from released to engaged.
Setting changes Jaw from released to held back.
Setting changes Trap from sprung to set.
Animal handles Triggering.
Triggering changes Trigger from at rest to pressed.
Triggering changes Catch from engaged to released.
Triggering changes Locking Bar from engaged to disengaged.
Triggering invokes Springing.
Springing requires Locking Bar at state disengaged.
Springing requires Transverse Spring.
Springing changes Jaw from held back to released.
Springing changes Animal from free to caught.
Springing changes Trap from set to sprung.
